# vacti arsenal - FULL (VACTI_FULL_ARSENAL=1)
#
# The web-lean CORE PLUS the per-vertical apt sets from the engine's
# bootstrap-apt.sh (APT_PKGS_SOURCE / APT_PKGS_MOBILE / APT_PKGS_IOS /
# APT_PKGS_RE). The heavy NON-apt tools (jadx, Ghidra, frida/objection,
# pymobiledevice3, semgrep, the RE python venv, the AD/cloud tooling) are NOT
# apt packages and are intentionally omitted here - the runtime arsenal-check
# fetches them post-boot via the vacti-engine-arsenal-apt NOPASSWD grant when
# the engine's ENGINE_CAPABILITIES advertises the matching vertical. Baking a
# multi-GB superset is deliberately avoided; the image stays a recent base.
#
# gen-live-build-list.sh includes this file instead of web-lean.list when
# VACTI_FULL_ARSENAL=1.

# ---- inherit the web-lean CORE ----
# (gen-live-build-list.sh concatenates web-lean.list first, then the sets below)

# --- source-review vertical (kind=source) ---
trivy

# --- mobile (Android) vertical ---
scrcpy
apktool
aapt

# --- iOS vertical ---
usbmuxd
libimobiledevice-utils
libplist-utils
llvm

# --- reverse-engineering / binary+firmware vertical ---
gdb-multiarch
binwalk
strace
ltrace
tshark
checksec
